Z||000002||JSocha||11-14-2001||04:12 PM||||1.  You could hit the ICON for "Reply with Quote" located above each post...Looks like  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/quote.gif"> .<P>2.  Or you need to type the following in front "quote" With [ ] around it and end it with "/quote" again with [ ] around it where I've placed and substituted [ ] with " marks.<P>3.  Click on the Smilies Legend link to the left where you are typing these messages in.  It will list the SMILIE along with the format you need.<P>4.  Hit the EDIT button on somebody elses post and look for the area where any of the information shows up to see how they did it.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 11-14-2001).]||||reg||1
